@baseUrl=http://localhost:8080

### Create tournament registration (requires existing team/tournament IDs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/inscriptiontournament/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "team": {"id": 1},
  "tournament": {"id": 1}
}

### cases of errors

### Create tournament registration (requires existing team/tournament IDs)
### with empty field
POST {{baseUrl}}/inscriptiontournament/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "team": {},
  "tournament": {"id": 1}
}

